    "enUS": {
      "description": "The aged scabbard is embellished with carved designs and markings. This matches the description spoken by the war veteran. A dramatic view of the land below is a breathtaking sight.\r\n\r\nPerhaps simply holding the scabbard in your hand while remembering the veteran's words will beckon the spirit to this memory.",
